('unaligned_drop','behavior',{'wifiDrop':True,'bleDrop':True,'clocksAligned':False},'The radio timelines have not been aligned.','The supplied times cannot establish simultaneous changes.','Resolve clock offsets before making a cross-radio temporal claim.'),
