('repeatable_recipe','workflow',{'recipeRequested':True},'Preserve the interpretation as an explicit passive analytic.','A reusable recipe needs declared inputs, identity keys, windows, scope and evidence limits.','Save the versioned recipe after the user reviews its meaning.'),
('tool_conflict','workflow',{'toolsDisagree':True},'The tools disagree about part of the evidence.','A disagreement needs reconciliation of source, decoder version and visibility; it is not resolved by choosing the most alarming answer.','Compare source references and input contracts.'),
